  - id: two_tablets
    displayName: Two Tablets
    flavorText: The Ten Commandments, restated in full to a new generation.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'Re-given word for word to the generation that was not at Sinai - explicitly
      framed as THEIR covenant now, not an inherited one: ''The LORD made not this
      covenant with our fathers, but with us, even us, who are all of us here alive
      this day'' (5:3).'
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
    managerId: ten_commandments
