  - id: doorpost_scroll
    displayName: Doorpost Scroll
    flavorText: The Shema - bound into daily life, not encountered once and set aside.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: '''Hear, O Israel: The LORD our God is one LORD'' - the foundational
      confession undergirding every other law in the book, meant to be taught constantly
      and bound into daily life (hands, forehead, doorposts) rather than encountered
      once and set aside.'
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
    managerId: the_shema
