  - id: boundary_stone
    displayName: Boundary Stone
    flavorText: '''Thou shalt not remove thy neighbour''s landmark.'''
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'The bulk of the book (chapters 12-26) - law adapted specifically for
      settled life in the land, not the wilderness camp: one central place of worship,
      kingship rules, courts and judges, warfare conduct, property and landmark law.'
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
    managerId: laws_for_the_land
