  - id: twin_mountains
    displayName: Twin Mountains
    flavorText: Blessing from Gerizim, cursing from Ebal - obedience made a staged,
      communal choice.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A physical ceremony planned for the moment they enter the land - half
      the tribes standing on Mount Gerizim for blessing, half on Mount Ebal for cursing
      - making the choice between obedience and disobedience a literal, staged, communal
      event.
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
    managerId: covenant_ceremony
