  - id: witness_song
    displayName: Witness Song
    flavorText: A song commanded to outlast Moses, testifying after he is gone.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Commanded by God to be written down and taught specifically because
      it will outlast Moses himself - 'this song shall testify against them as a
      witness' (31:21) after the people inevitably drift, when there's no living
      leader left to confront them directly.
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
