  - id: tribal_blessing_scroll
    displayName: Tribal Blessing Scroll
    flavorText: Moses' final act - a blessing for each tribe before he climbs the
      mountain to die.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Moses' final act before going up the mountain to die - a personal blessing
      for each tribe, echoing Jacob's blessing of his twelve sons back in Genesis
      49, closing the loop from the family that went down into Egypt to the nation
      about to enter the land.
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
    managerId: blessing_of_tribes
